{"version":1,"content":"<p>AI太懂你了，簡直讓人毛骨悚然！這幾天， <strong>一個「空房間」的實驗再度爆火</strong>，引全網數百萬人圍觀。網友Jakub Szymczuk也跟風測了一把。他隨手丟給ChatGPT一張家徒四壁的灰色毛坯房照片，只敲了一行字：「<strong>用你所知道的關於我的信息，填滿這個房間</strong>」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585760.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.112963+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:48:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"ffe56dc0c0ccee914f37bae74a44f64e2ffce792475edb49e1d45af3ac459f60","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}